run writeCoercionArrayEqFalseExplanationLineCall
ignore void source writeCoercionArrayEqFalseExplanationLineCall
bind error writeCoercionArrayEqFalseExplanationLineError ConsoleWriteError writeCoercionArrayEqFalseExplanationLineCall
set memory lastConsoleWriteErrorCode writeCoercionArrayEqFalseExplanationLineError
branch error source writeCoercionArrayEqFalseExplanationLineCall target consoleWriteFailed

