argument writeCoercionArrayEqNotArrayLineCall text String coercionArrayEqNotArrayText
run writeCoercionArrayEqNotArrayLineCall
ignore void source writeCoercionArrayEqNotArrayLineCall
bind error writeCoercionArrayEqNotArrayLineError ConsoleWriteError writeCoercionArrayEqNotArrayLineCall
set memory lastConsoleWriteErrorCode writeCoercionArrayEqNotArrayLineError
branch error source writeCoercionArrayEqNotArrayLineCall target consoleWriteFailed

call writeCoercionArrayEqNotArrayExplanationLineCall writeStandardOutputLine
