call writeCoercionBooleanStringFalseLineCall writeStandardOutputLine
argument writeCoercionBooleanStringFalseLineCall text String coercionBooleanStringFalseText
run writeCoercionBooleanStringFalseLineCall
ignore void source writeCoercionBooleanStringFalseLineCall
bind error writeCoercionBooleanStringFalseLineError ConsoleWriteError writeCoercionBooleanStringFalseLineCall
set memory lastConsoleWriteErrorCode writeCoercionBooleanStringFalseLineError
